WEBVTT

00:24:58.490 --> 00:25:00.631
"You know what?
I'm a pretty creative person!"

00:25:00.631 --> 00:25:02.781
what David Kelly calls
"creative confidence."

00:25:02.781 --> 00:25:05.930
So, we know you can do it,
thank you very much.

00:25:05.930 --> 00:25:07.321
It's simple:

00:25:07.321 --> 00:25:09.181
get curious,

00:25:09.181 --> 00:25:10.529
talk to people

00:25:10.529 --> 00:25:11.880
and try stuff,

00:25:11.880 --> 00:25:14.452
and you will design
a well-lived and joyful life.

00:25:14.452 --> 00:25:15.751
Thank you.

00:25:15.751 --> 00:25:17.669
(Applause) (Cheers)